  "translation": "Yu, wokman bilong mi Yakov, no ken sikret — tok bilong Yahwe — bilong mi stap wantaim ⟨את⟩ yu; bilong mi bai bagarapim olgeta ol lain we mi puspim yu i go long ol; tasol ⟨את⟩ yu, mi no ken bagarapim; na mi skarim yu long kot; na mi no ken larim yu go nating.",
